OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA rather cloudy day with the
OL,6,Fchance of the odd shower, mainly in
OL,7,Fthe north and west. Most places
OL,8,Fstaying dry with periods of hazy
OL,9,Fsunshine. Breezier and somewhat
OL,10,Ffresher but still feeling rather warm
OL,11,Ffor the time of year.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FDry to start but rain moves
OL,14,Fin from the west. Mostly light but
OL,15,Fturning showery into the early hours.
OL,16,FShowers ease by dawn becoming
OL,17,Fisolated. Feeling fresher and less
OL,18,Fhumid.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
