OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FThe odd isolated shower
OL,6,Fremains through the day, but most
OL,7,Fplaces staying dry with bright and
OL,8,Fsunny spells. Temperatures around, or
OL,9,Fjust below average for the time of
OL,10,Fyear.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FA
OL,13,Fnortherly wind develops for the next
OL,14,Ffew days, allowing temperatures to
OL,15,Fdrop below average. Thunder showers
OL,16,Ffor Thursday and Friday, but brighter
OL,17,Fand drier for Saturday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
